title: Table3A
---
// Talk target of the chair at Samantha's table (Hotspots layer). Her notebook lies on it.
-> Sit down <<if can("R1Dinner1", "dinner")>>
    <<next_scene Route1Dinner>>
-> Look at her notebook <<if can("R1Dinner1", "peek") and not is_done("R1Dinner1", "dinner")>>
    <<done R1Dinner1 peek>>
    <<done R1Dinner1 notes>>
    // PLACEHOLDER lines.
    You: Her notebook. My name's on a page.
    {$samantha_name}: Ah. That's mine. You'll hear it at dinner.
-> Open the wine <<if can("R1Dinner2", "open")>>
    <<set $item_corkscrew to false>>
    <<done R1Dinner2 open>>
    <<note r1_thu2 "Sit at her table.">>
    You: There.
    {$samantha_name}: Two glasses. Not to the top.
-> Sit down <<if in_box("R1Dinner2") and is_done("R1Dinner2", "door") and not is_done("R1Dinner2", "dinner")>>
    <<if can("R1Dinner2", "dinner")>>
        <<next_scene Route1Thu2Dinner>>
    <<else>>
        {$samantha_name}: Wine first. Corkscrew. Drawer. Sink.
    <<endif>>
-> Look at her notebook <<if in_box("R1Dinner2") and is_done("R1Dinner2", "door") and not is_done("R1Dinner2", "dinner")>>
    You: Her notebook. Closed, with a pen clipped to it.
-> Open her notebook <<if can("R1Dinner2", "notebook") and not is_done("R1Dinner2", "dinner")>>
    <<done R1Dinner2 notebook>>
    {$samantha_name}: Ah.
    {$samantha_name}: That's mine.
-> Look
    <<if can("R1Dinner1", "dishes")>>
        {$samantha_name}: Dinner's over. The sink isn't going to come to you.
    <<else>>
        You: Her table. Her notebook on it, closed.
    <<endif>>
===
